//RS //! Typed operation-history generation, dependency-aware shrinking, and replay artifacts.
//RS //!
//RS //! A history is a bounded sequence of checked operations, not a byte-fuzzing
//RS //! corpus.  The operation metadata keeps resource handles, task/event
//RS //! dependencies, and schedule choices visible while the runner delegates the
//RS //! verdict to [`crate::TestingComparison`].  The model and candidate are
//RS //! supplied by the caller; this module never derives an oracle from either one.
//RS 
